Cell["Static Clearance", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953705628345084*^9, 
  3.953705634296365*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f33a3bee-ea3a-479b-b3dd-\
a8a47be2c637"],

Cell["\<\
For the truck to clear the topbar, topbar height must be at least the maximum \
value of the roof height function.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953705637819405*^9, 
  3.953705673577053*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dd28b21d-599d-45a5-b8a3-\
47e56ea3fa2d"]
